# Copy to /etc/systemd/system/k3s.service.env on the node (systemd reads it for the k3s unit), then `systemctl restart k3s`.
# Go collects garbage only when the heap has doubled. k3s holds about 420 MiB of live data; without a limit it grew to 1.2 GB resident,
# with a soft limit the heap goal stays near 550 MiB and the process near 900 MiB. A soft limit: above it the GC runs more often, nothing is killed. ADR 0042.
GOMEMLIMIT=800MiB
